        <mxCell id="blend" value="&#375;&lt;sup&gt;sm&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;sub&gt;i&lt;/sub&gt; = (1 &#8722; &#945;) &#375;&lt;sub&gt;i&lt;/sub&gt; + &#945; &#183; mean&lt;sub&gt;kNN(i)&lt;/sub&gt; &#375;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;leaf-graph smoothing (&#945; &#8712; [0,1] fit on validation)&lt;br&gt;prediction smoothing &#8212; not a GNN, not a feature&lt;br&gt;&#8594; &#375;&lt;sup&gt;sm&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;sub&gt;i,t+h&lt;/sub&gt; : final smoothed forecast" style="text;html=1;align=center;fontSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1">
